{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "691cd148-46ec-8197-9856-7d87c9bc12f4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:28:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:25:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I'm calling about a storm drain, well, a catch basin, on my street. Four fifteen Mill Street, up in Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:25:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, four fifteen Mill Street. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:26:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So there's a snowbank sitting right on top of the basin. Left over from the plow. And the water can't get in, so it pools across the whole lane. It's a big puddle, and it's not even raining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. So no storm right now, just the snowmelt and the bank blocking it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:26:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. It's dry out. Just the melt coming down the hill and nowhere to go. It's turning to ice at night, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the basin's buried and the water's spreading across the road. Let me write that down. Is it in front of the house or down the block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:26:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the corner by my house. Maybe ten feet from my driveway. The basin is on the downhill side of the lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And is the water getting onto anyone's property, or just the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:26:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the street so far. My neighbor said it happens every big rain, though. Even without snow. She said the water just sits there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's good to know. I'll put that in the notes, that it's a repeat spot. That helps the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:27:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I only moved here in the fall, so I didn't know. I used to have a carpool lane on my old commute, which I really miss, honestly. Here it's all side streets."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, not a lot of carpool lanes in Newport. Alright, so I'll send this over as a blocked catch basin with ponding at four fifteen Mill. Crew will have to dig it out and check that it's draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:27:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Could somebody call me back when it's done? I'd like to know it's cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:27:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's four oh one, five five five, oh one eight two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:28:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight two. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:28:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maria Medeiros. M-E-D-E-I-R-O-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:28:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Maria. I've got you down for a callback once the work's finished. Anything else going on over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:28:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:28:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:28:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
